{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Planning-metadata repair receipt for the four open leaves under `popular-stretchy-mussel`.\n\nBases: frozen prose `d6669496cae441fc8381b5ee6de21a3993defd84`; current-code AST `6e3c3571dd5b4f82a0faf55ac4b3f3a44401b708`.\n\n- `incurable-geometric-liger`: 58 blocks = 41 docstrings + 17 full-line comment regions; 5,246 words; 0 directives; 0 shebangs; description 7,326 chars.\n- `snoopy-humorous-doe`: 73 blocks = 63 docstrings + 10 full-line comment regions; 5,166 words; 8 directives; 0 shebangs; description 7,671 chars.\n- `unplayful-bizarre-sable`: 33 blocks = 28 docstrings + 5 full-line comment regions; 4,049 words; 7 directives; 0 shebangs; description 5,473 chars.\n- `strenuous-aged-sablefish`: 32 blocks = 24 docstrings + 8 full-line comment regions; 2,858 words; 6 directives; 0 shebangs; description 5,288 chars.\n\nPersisted 72 ordered file-impact rows total (18 per leaf) and 28 DD commands total (7 per leaf: semantic, directives, paths, diff, focused, hygiene, full). Inventory, command syntax, frozen/current selected-prose identity, and safe semantic/directive oracle simulations passed.\n\nTracker evidence: the pre-write four-ID MCP summary produced no response for >90 seconds and was terminated; serial worktree-venv CLI `show --output json` fallback confirmed every leaf open, unassigned, and unsigned. All 12 serial MCP metadata writes returned `result=ok`, `push_status.state=ok`, and no warnings. Subsequent serial MCP `show_ticket` readback matched every description byte, ordered `{path,reason}` row, and normalized `{dd_id,dd_text,command}` triple exactly. All four still read open, assignee null, and attestations empty.\n\nScope remained planning metadata only: no claim, review, transition, source edit, test/gate execution, commit, code push, or ticket-status/assignee/signature change."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788635461655678482,"uuid":"1e40682f-3722-4ca9-a379-fbc75142313f"}